"Odoo para empresas de logística</font>\n"
"                </strong>\n"
"                !</span>\n"
"            <br/>"

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<span class=\"h6-fs\">When you need to manually move stock—like returning "
"items to a\n"
"                quality check location or moving products after a customer "
"validation—use an\n"
"                internal transfer.<strong/></span>\n"
"            <br/>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"h6-fs\">Cuando necesites mover stock de forma manual (como "
"devolver artículos a una\n"
"                ubicación de control de calidad o mover productos después de "
"la validación del cliente) utiliza un\n"
"                traslado interno.<strong/></span>\n"
"            <br/>"

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<span class=\"h6-fs\">You can add specific quality checks required by your "
"customer. For\n"
"                each check, define how it should be performed, when it "
"should be completed, and\n"
"                which samples it applies to.</span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"h6-fs\">Puedes añadir controles de calidad específicos que "
"haya pedido tu cliente. En\n"
"                cada control de calidad debes definir cómo se debe realizar, "
"cuándo se debe completar y\n"
"                a qué ejemplares aplica.</span>"

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
