"Select the scheduled receipt date and add all products with their quantities."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona la fecha de recepción programada y añade todos los productos con "
"sus cantidades."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
