#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The Storage Report pulls data from <b>Inventory/Reporting/Stock History</b>."
msgstr ""
"El informe de almacenamiento obtiene datos del <b>historial de inventario, "
"informes y stock</b>."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The app streamlines the invoicing process for these\n"
"            agreements. Additionally, you can access reports on occupancy "
"and dates to help\n"
"            anticipate and manage your storage capacity."
msgstr ""
"La aplicación simplifica el proceso de facturación para estos\n"
"            acuerdos. Además, puedes acceder a informes sobre ocupación y "
"fechas para\n"
"            ayudar a anticipar y gestionar tu capacidad de almacenamiento."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The barcode app can be installed as a\n"
"                        standalone application on devices. This means people "
"can use it without\n"
"                        having access to the rest of the database."
msgstr ""
"La aplicación Código de barras se puede instalar como\n"
"                        una aplicación independiente en los dispositivos. "
"Esto significa que los usuarios pueden utilizarla sin\n"
"                        tener acceso al resto de la base de datos."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid "The customer reminders."
msgstr "Los recordatorios del cliente."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The customer will then receive an email with instructions to create their "
"account."
msgstr ""
"El cliente recibirá un correo con las instrucciones para crear su cuenta."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The dashboard provides all the necessary information,\n"
"            including storage occupancy, completed transfers, created "
"packages, and performed\n"
"            quality checks. You just need to manually adjust the quantities "
"on your invoices using\n"
"            this data."
msgstr ""
"El tablero proporciona toda la información necesaria,\n"
"            Incluyendo la ocupación del almacén, las transferencias "
"completadas, los paquetes creados y las comprobaciones\n"
"            de calidad realizadas. Solo tienes que ajustar las cantidades en "
"tus facturas manualmente utilizando\n"
"            estos datos."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid "The dashboard provides the following reports:"
msgstr "El tablero proporciona los siguientes informes:"

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid "The financial reporting."
msgstr "Los informes financieros."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The process for outbound product deliveries is similar to receiving products."
msgstr ""
"El proceso para las entregas de productos salientes es similar al de "
"recepción de productos."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The standard settings for customer products are <b>traced by lot</b>\n"
"                                    with <b>no expiration date</b>."
msgstr ""
"Los ajustes estándar para los productos del cliente son <b>con seguimiento "
"por lote</b>\n"
"                                    sin <b>fecha de caducidad</b>."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid "The synchronisation with the banks."
msgstr "La sincronización con los bancos."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid "The vendor bills payment."
